{"id":"dfd5eac03a7e2f83","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-deficiency.md","title":"缺陷阶段与真阶段","display":"df-deficiency — 缺陷阶段与真阶段","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-deficiency","aliases":["20-df-deficiency"],"display":"df-deficiency — 缺陷阶段与真阶段","chapter":"5","section":"5.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 5.3.5","source_pdf_pages":[150],"source_printed_pages":[115],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-deficiency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-deficiency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deficiency — 缺陷阶段与真阶段"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.3.5"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>150</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>115</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为无限 c.e. 集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 单射且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s=\\{f(t):t\\le s\\}\">\\(A_s=\\{f(t):t\\le s\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD_f:=\\{s:\\exists t&gt;s\\ [f(t)&lt;f(s)]\\},\\qquad T_f:=\\omega\\setminus D_f,\\\\\ns\\in T_f\\Longleftrightarrow A\\cap[0,f(s))=A_s\\cap[0,f(s)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD_f:=\\{s:\\exists t&gt;s\\ [f(t)&lt;f(s)]\\},\\qquad T_f:=\\omega\\setminus D_f,\\\\\ns\\in T_f\\Longleftrightarrow A\\cap[0,f(s))=A_s\\cap[0,f(s)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>真阶段表示刚枚举成员以下的初段已经正确。最后一个等价依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 单射及枚举无遗漏；不得忽略这些条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.3.5；印刷页 115；PDF 第 150 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A","display":false},{"tex":"A_s=\\{f(t):t\\le s\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deficiency}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD_f:=\\{s:\\exists t>s\\ [f(t)<f(s)]\\},\\qquad T_f:=\\omega\\setminus D_f,\\\\\ns\\in T_f\\Longleftrightarrow A\\cap[0,f(s))=A_s\\cap[0,f(s)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1159,"backlinks":[{"id":"f222b74804c56f9b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deficiency]]；see [[20-df-hypersimple]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-principal-function]]；see [[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","e343870c773cb68e"]}